      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Newtonville sits at the intersection of Maxwell Road and US Route 9, just south of Latham and north of Loudonville.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
